{
    "title": "SwingU: Golf GPS Range Finder",
    "description": "SwingU is the top-performing, free golf range finder & scorecard app. Trusted by more than 7 million golfers around the globe!\r\n \r\nThe SwingU golf app is FREE FOR LIFE and extremely accurate, reliable, and battery-efficient. SwingU outperforms expensive, handheld golf range finders and other golf yardage apps.\r\n \r\nWHAT YOU GET WHEN YOU DOWNLOAD\r\n\u2022 Golf GPS range finder that works on every course in the world with distances to greens and hazards\r\n\u2022 Digital scorecard that easily tracks your score & putts and auto advances hole-to-hole\r\n\u2022 Free handicap tracker after posting scores from 3 rounds\r\n\u2022 Track your shots and gain insights on how far you hit your clubs\r\n\u2022 Distance finder: Tap the flag on any hole and get distances to 5+ tiers of the green\r\n\u2022 Daily golf instruction tip from our team of top-100 instructors\r\n\u2022 GPS for Watch / Wear OS \u2013 get distances and keep score for you and your friends\r\n\u2022 Health features have been included when using the Watch on the course; e.g. track calories burned\r\n \r\nWHY DO MILLIONS OF GOLFERS USE THE SWINGU GOLF GPS APP?\r\n\u2022 Reliable and easy to use \u2013 one tap and you\u2019re playing\r\n\u2022 Constantly improving with new functionality and new technology\r\n\u2022 Commitment to user satisfaction with quick, reliable customer service\r\n\u2022 The only golfer community-verified course database in the world\r\n \r\nUPGRADE TO PLUS FOR A COMPLETE DIGITAL CADDIE EXPERIENCE\r\n \r\nUpgrade to SwingU Plus, our AI-powered digital caddie platform with the following:\r\n \r\n\u2022 \u201cPlays like\u201d yardages using live wind speed & elevation\r\n\u2022 Club recommendations based on your club distances, shot tracking, wind speed & elevation\r\n\u2022 Green Maps for over 13,000 courses powered by StrackaLine\r\n\u2022 Hole insights \u2013 your hole stats vs. all SwingU golfers, showing your tendencies for strategic decision making\r\n\u2022 Hole notes \u2013 record notes / reminders per hole and reference those notes next time you play the course\r\n\u2022 Enhanced golf scorecard & stats \u2013 record your score, putts, driver accuracy, bunker play, and penalty tracking and get detailed round summaries revealing strengths and weaknesses\r\n\u2022 On-the-course games \u2013 handicap-adjusted scoring including Stroke Play, Skins, Stableford, Match Play & Nassau.\r\n \r\nUPGRADE TO PRO FOR ELITE GOLFER PERFORMANCE & TRAINING\r\n \r\nUpgrade to SwingU Pro to access our elite golfer game-improvement platform, including the following:\r\n \r\n\u2022 SwingU Versus, the world\u2019s easiest-to-use strokes gained statistics platform, used by more than 50 active tour players and 100+ active college golfers\r\n\u2022 Stats & performance comparison vs. your target handicap (ranging from +6 to 30 handicaps)\r\n\u2022 Relative handicap for every facet of the game: driving, approach, short game, bunker play & putting\r\n\u2022 Post-round #1 game-improvement priority & prescriptive drill from a top-100 teacher revealing where you should focus your practice time\r\n\u2022 Anytime, anywhere access to 600+ lessons or drills from top-100 teachers\r\n\u2022 All features of SwingU Plus\r\n\r\nAs a registered user, you'll be subscribed to the world\u2019s top golf daily newsletter which includes promotions from our partners. You can 1-click unsubscribe at any time.\r\n \r\nDespite years of optimizing the app, constant use of GPS running in the background can decrease battery life.\r\n \r\nFull terms and the EULA are available at:\r\n\u2022 swingu.com/terms-of-service/\r\n\u2022 clubhouse.swingu.com/eula/",
    "descriptionHTML": "SwingU is the top-performing, free golf range finder &amp; scorecard app. Trusted by more than 7 million golfers around the globe!<br> <br>The SwingU golf app is FREE FOR LIFE and extremely accurate, reliable, and battery-efficient. SwingU outperforms expensive, handheld golf range finders and other golf yardage apps.<br> <br>WHAT YOU GET WHEN YOU DOWNLOAD<br>\u2022 Golf GPS range finder that works on every course in the world with distances to greens and hazards<br>\u2022 Digital scorecard that easily tracks your score &amp; putts and auto advances hole-to-hole<br>\u2022 Free handicap tracker after posting scores from 3 rounds<br>\u2022 Track your shots and gain insights on how far you hit your clubs<br>\u2022 Distance finder: Tap the flag on any hole and get distances to 5+ tiers of the green<br>\u2022 Daily golf instruction tip from our team of top-100 instructors<br>\u2022 GPS for Watch / Wear OS \u2013 get distances and keep score for you and your friends<br>\u2022 Health features have been included when using the Watch on the course; e.g. track calories burned<br> <br>WHY DO MILLIONS OF GOLFERS USE THE SWINGU GOLF GPS APP?<br>\u2022 Reliable and easy to use \u2013 one tap and you\u2019re playing<br>\u2022 Constantly improving with new functionality and new technology<br>\u2022 Commitment to user satisfaction with quick, reliable customer service<br>\u2022 The only golfer community-verified course database in the world<br> <br>UPGRADE TO PLUS FOR A COMPLETE DIGITAL CADDIE EXPERIENCE<br> <br>Upgrade to SwingU Plus, our AI-powered digital caddie platform with the following:<br> <br>\u2022 \u201cPlays like\u201d yardages using live wind speed &amp; elevation<br>\u2022 Club recommendations based on your club distances, shot tracking, wind speed &amp; elevation<br>\u2022 Green Maps for over 13,000 courses powered by StrackaLine<br>\u2022 Hole insights \u2013 your hole stats vs. all SwingU golfers, showing your tendencies for strategic decision making<br>\u2022 Hole notes \u2013 record notes / reminders per hole and reference those notes next time you play the course<br>\u2022 Enhanced golf scorecard &amp; stats \u2013 record your score, putts, driver accuracy, bunker play, and penalty tracking and get detailed round summaries revealing strengths and weaknesses<br>\u2022 On-the-course games \u2013 handicap-adjusted scoring including Stroke Play, Skins, Stableford, Match Play &amp; Nassau.<br> <br>UPGRADE TO PRO FOR ELITE GOLFER PERFORMANCE &amp; TRAINING<br> <br>Upgrade to SwingU Pro to access our elite golfer game-improvement platform, including the following:<br> <br>\u2022 SwingU Versus, the world\u2019s easiest-to-use strokes gained statistics platform, used by more than 50 active tour players and 100+ active college golfers<br>\u2022 Stats &amp; performance comparison vs. your target handicap (ranging from +6 to 30 handicaps)<br>\u2022 Relative handicap for every facet of the game: driving, approach, short game, bunker play &amp; putting<br>\u2022 Post-round #1 game-improvement priority &amp; prescriptive drill from a top-100 teacher revealing where you should focus your practice time<br>\u2022 Anytime, anywhere access to 600+ lessons or drills from top-100 teachers<br>\u2022 All features of SwingU Plus<br><br>As a registered user, you&#39;ll be subscribed to the world\u2019s top golf daily newsletter which includes promotions from our partners. You can 1-click unsubscribe at any time.<br> <br>Despite years of optimizing the app, constant use of GPS running in the background can decrease battery life.<br> <br>Full terms and the EULA are available at:<br>\u2022 swingu.com/terms-of-service/<br>\u2022 clubhouse.swingu.com/eula/",
